    "customer_reviews_section_t7XbEW": {
      "type": "customer-reviews-section",
      "blocks": {
        "content_NjemDU": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/testi-thrd.webp",
            "enable_rating": true,
            "the_text": "<p>As so many of my colleagues, we are always searching for the most optimal supplements for our clients.  While keeping in mind effectiveness, cost and purity, well you can stop looking. Tribe Organics meets all of the requirements for me.  I see results, great quality and reasonably priced.</p><h3>- Yolonda King-Taylor</h3><h4>Holistic Health Practitioner and Certified Wellness Coach</h4>"
          }
        },
        "content_hcB9iz": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/testi-sec.webp",
            "enable_rating": true,
            "the_text": "<p>I am always looking for the best products for my customers; ones that are sustainable, organic & a good price point. My customers have been loving Tribe Organics. I personally am especially loving the new Ashwagandha KSM-66 Gummies, they are so tasty. Thank you for making such good quality products with ethical standards behind the product production. I highly recommend Tribe Organics! </p><h3>- Krystal Pearson L.Ac.</h3><h4>Licensed Acupuncturist, Herbalist & Reiki Master</h4>"
          }
        },
        "content_e9X9c3": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/testi-one.webp",
            "enable_rating": true,
            "the_text": "<p>I have tried other Ashwagandha supplements and none have been nearly as effective as Tribe Organics! After mixing the powder into a smoothie or even a baked good recipe, there’s a noticeable difference in my energy levels and overall mood. I feel balanced, yet energized and clear headed. This is my favorite way to increase productivity with computer work without the crash that caffeine brings! I highly recommend this supplement for an overall improvement of well-being.</p><h3>- Rohini Elyse Mauk</h3><h4>Reiki Master</h4>"
          }
        },
        "content_gEraxh": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/jassy.jpg",
            "enable_rating": true,
            "the_text": "<p>I wanted to share my experience using Tribe Organics nutritional products. I have been using them for the last 4 years in my practice and for myself. I have been in practice over 40 years and I have found my patients respond in a very positive way to their products. I would highly recommend you try their products.</p><h3>- Keith Jassy </h3><h4>Chiropractic and Nutrition Analysis.</h4>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
