            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "date_text": "12/05/24",
            "title": "Oh my, I have energy now",
            "sub_title": "<p>I had gotten to the point where I literally was so exhausted it was hard to put one foot in front of the other. My personality is such I think my cortisol has always been elevated, hence exhausted adrenals. I have been taking this product for several weeks and feel so much better. I am amazed at how much better I feel and how much energy I have now, I am actually getting things done for a change. Thank you so much for this product.</p><p>- Linda</p>",
            "bottom_text": "Results may vary by individual."
          }
        },
        "content_fFkCBc": {
