            "date_text": "10/31/24",
            "title": "Good price point and better than other Ashwagandha supplements",
            "sub_title": "<p>This is an affordable price for a good-quality product. It works better than other ashwagandha supplements I have used in the past. I'll order again.</p><p>- Jennifer Cerny</p>",
