            "date_text": "09/08/24",
            "title": "Nature's chill pill",
            "sub_title": "<p>As a woman in menopause, I read an article by a holistic doctor who said Ashwagandha helped her stay balanced and calm and without cortisol spikes during menopause, so I took her advice. It works, and now I tell everyone it’s great during menopause.</p><p>- Debra Adrienne</p>",
