        "custom_html": "<p data-aos=\"fade-up\">TRIIBE is dedicated to helping anyone who wants to better themselves; physically, mentally and spiritually. That’s what really gets our fire burning. But, still, it’s not all about us. We’re part of an ecosystem, of communities, we are nothing without the world around us. The natural world is where we get the goods we send to you, it’s where the trees we love to look at live, where the birds build their nests. We are nothing if we don’t take care of the world around us.</p>\n<p data-aos=\"fade-up\">TRIIBE takes three things very seriously: our people, our world, our mission.</p>\n<p data-aos=\"fade-up\">We vow for transparency, so that you can see exactly what we are doing together. Our work with 1% for the Planet, our never ending battle for sustainability and the pure, unadulterated good stuff we are putting in our bodies.</p>",
